# Python byte-code caches
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]

# Bundled zip archive of collection 203 — the exampleData/*.xdi
# files are the tracked, unpacked form.
exampleData/*.zip

# JetBrains IDE settings — local to one developer's machine
.idea/

# Pages build output: tools/generate_glossary_html.py and
# generate_concept_files.py write here, and CI regenerates it on every
# deploy. This used to be /XAS-CDIF-1.0_release/, which collided with the
# tracked archive/ copy of the published 1.0 deliverable -- generated
# output for the CURRENT glossary sat in a directory named for the 1.0
# release, and the two were repeatedly mistaken for each other.
/build/
